<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam Jan-May industrial output up y/y 13.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Vietnam Jan-May industrial output up y/y 13.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's industrial production in the first five months of this year was 13.7 percent higher than in the same period of 1996, the Vietnam General Statistics Office said on Wednesday.</p>
